# pdf.js worker, character maps and standard fonts.
# Copied out of node_modules by scripts/copy-pdfjs-assets.mjs on postinstall,
# so they are always in step with the installed pdfjs-dist. Committing them
# would only create a version to drift out of step with. `npm ci` runs
# postinstall, which is what puts them in the image.
